# ROSE's own store, ignored here because this repo's lessons are about ROSE
# development rather than something to ship. In a normal project you usually
# WANT to commit .rose/nodes and .rose/episodes so the team shares the lessons and
# their regression corpus — `.rose/.gitignore` already excludes the machine-local
# parts (sessions/, events.jsonl). See docs/integration.md.
.rose/
!examples/**/.rose/
sandbox/
*.log

